 - Experiment with pipelines to personalize models at scale, leveraging synthetic data and production feedback;

 - Ensure customer success, owning problems end-to-end from ideation to deployment, validation, and production;

 - Work closely with our research staff, productionizing the latest frontier research initiatives;

 - Contribute to our product roadmap, identifying promising trends and customer needs;

 - Report clearly on your work to a distributed collaborative team, with a bias for asynchronous written communication.


