 - Proven experience with infrastructure-as-code (IaC), particularly Terraform and CloudFormation, for managing scalable and reproducible environments across internal and external deployments;

 - 4+ years of experience managing containerized environments, with expertise in container security, networking, and orchestration (Kubernetes preferred);

 - Backend programming skills (e.g., Rust, Python, Typescript and/or Node);

 - Track record of operating & securing B2B SaaS systems;

